2-9165-4645c2ca338c" label="lyrics-like">ctum tú-um, et confité-bor nómini tú-o. Gló-ri-a Pátri.</l><l xml:id="m-9d9383e2-0575-4ea9-b4f2-db980add40bd" facs="#m-bb5bf198-b048-42c9-932c-15fa378c9d21" label="lyrics-like">V. Adoráte Déum. (P. T. Allelúia.)</l><l xml:id="m-d4a48f9a-2c54-4f0e-82ff-ab08c9fd3eb5" facs="#m-82d77636-20d9-4564-ae5b-3f35d7a0ff46" label="lyrics-like">K. Omnes Angeli éjus. (P. T. Allefúia.)</l><l xml:id="m-b2623660-8a37-4bdb-949a-1958e1670cd1" facs="#m-3029ff7c-8e7e-460a-904a-ac6126852311" label="text-like">AT SECOND VESPERS.</l><l xml:id="m-521e4f9f-400e-4959-85ad-be55b649194b" facs="#m-5681eb81-054b-4362-9264-eb6091e48130" label="lyrics-like">Psalms. 1. Díxit Dóminus. 4. Ax. p. 130. — 2. Confitébor. 7. a. p. 139.</l><l xml:id="m-d153f9cd-e04c-4697-b1e2-0300b7abfdb9" facs="#m-0f17f1e6-b36f-42bc-b6b5-6d6beb609867" label="lyrics-like">- 3. Beátus vir. 8. G. D. 147.— 4. Laudáte púeri. T. peregr. D. 152.</l><l xml:id="m-fca945cf-f88e-4ede-b110-cf6f5c02c175" facs="#m-43b4708c-b2ba-461f-a6cd-ebc340419f36" label="lyrics-like">— 5. Confitébor tibi... quóniam. 7. c. p. 183.</l><l xml:id="m-39fec635-2a34-4a0d-9ac5-e06449d5e0d3" facs="#m-ff3dae8f-c6b6-4cc2-9b97-3a5d7768818b" label="ambiguous">1.Ant.;</l><l xml:id="m-13052133-ce0b-45d2-9ee0-6a15d6f46351" facs="#m-efb27eb3-0018-407c-844c-c43cc0ff66d4" label="ambiguous">4.A</l><l xml:id="m-48fbc228-538d-459a-bbff-44ee9bf86c9e" facs="#m-083613ae-7312-4d5a-ab62-754775b36399" label="lyrics-like">Té-tit Ange-lus" juxta áram témpli, hábens</l><l xml:id="m-55a99862-1bf7-4b54-9b64-d2163ee1dac6" facs="#m-981ad7d4-61d1-4cee-b73d-afe3b945c578" label="lyrics-like">thu-ríbu-lum áure-um in mánu sú-a P. T. Alle-lú-ia¬</l><l xml:id="m-48d43f94-a995-42e2-899a-43d17fd1058e" facs="#m-08917886-ae0a-4598-bbe8-7d6fc4e8f697" label="ambiguous">2. Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-ec53d4a9-8af5-4604-8703-b09c994f5fc0" facs="#m-dcbf17e1-bf3e-40e7-a618-800b0cd9d8e2" label="ambiguous">7.a</l><l xml:id="m-8636bb0c-6463-4a81-9ac7-01a8d4285039" facs="#m-3b8aec64-ed45-4fdf-a02a-801963437b97" label="lyrics-like">UM praeli-a-ré- tur “Mícha-el</l><l xml:id="m-37ee9e65-f398-43b7-a3b3-6a1788611dad" facs="#m-fcb10719-1779-4544-9690-7ff6be8c6bd2" label="ambiguous">E u o u a e.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
